        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. 1. All permanent employees hired will be placed in a six-month probationary status during which time they will have no rights as unit members to contractual protection against termination without proper cause and whose rights, except as those provided by the Agreement, are to be determined in accordance with the Board of Education policies and regulations.",
